{"name":"Fireglow","hex":"#d65e40","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Sudden Strike","blocks":[{"text":"Sudden Strike is a series of real-time tactics video games set during World War II. The series is developed by Fireglow based in Russia and published by CDV software of Germany and has been re-published by ZOOM-Platform.com. The player selects a faction and gains control of many varied units such as infantry, tanks and artillery. The games focus primarily on tactics, eschewing traditional real-time strategy resource gathering and base development."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/52/Sudden_Strike_Logo.jpg/330px-Sudden_Strike_Logo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudden_Strike"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Wikia-Gamescom-2016-352_%2828475781333%29.jpg/500px-Wikia-Gamescom-2016-352_%2828475781333%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Wikia-Gamescom-2016-352_%2828475781333%29.jpg/1280px-Wikia-Gamescom-2016-352_%2828475781333%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Wikia-Gamescom-2016-352_%2828475781333%29.jpg/500px-Wikia-Gamescom-2016-352_%2828475781333%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Sudden Strike 4 promotion at Gamescom 2016","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWikia-Gamescom-2016-352_(28475781333).jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}